@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName "Monospace"

title Faseado de Implementación: Repopackage CLI

participant "Phase 1: Core & System" as P1 #F0F0F0
participant "Phase 2: Desk & Tasks" as P2
participant "Phase 3: Drawers & Promotion" as P3
participant "Phase 4: Exec & Capture" as P4
participant "Phase 5: Eval & Audit" as P5

== Core Infrastructure ==
P1 -> P1: Setup Typer Shell
P1 -> P1: Command: init-project
note right: Creación de 4-Zone model

== Work Surface ==
P2 -> P2: Command: tasks atomize
P2 -> P2: Command: board sync
note right: Manipulación de .md via Regex/Templates

== Backlog Management ==
P3 -> P3: Command: drawers add/list
P3 -> P3: Command: drawers promote
note right: Transformación Spec -> Task

== Agent Orchestration ==
P4 -> P4: Command: exec dispatch
P4 -> P4: Command: capture rescue
note right: Gestión de carpetas /runs/

== Quality Gate ==
P5 -> P5: Command: eval audit-laws
P5 -> P5: Command: eval test
note right: Validación de contratos y 80/10 rule

@enduml
